expression: normalized
---
Run eval cases against an agent

Usage: fastskill eval run [OPTIONS] --output-dir <output-dir>

Options:
  -a, --agent <agent>            Target runtime(s); repeatable (mutually exclusive with --all)
      --skills-dir <skills-dir>  Override the skills directory path
      --all                      Target all runtimes (mutually exclusive with --agent)
      --global                   Use global skills directory (~/.config/fastskill/skills)
      --output-dir <output-dir>  Output directory for artifacts (required)
  -v, --verbose                  Enable verbose output
      --model <model>            Optional model override forwarded to the agent
      --case <case>              Filter: run only the case with this ID
      --tag <tag>                Filter: run only cases with this tag
      --format <format>          Output format: table, json
      --json                     Shorthand for --format json
      --no-fail                  Do not fail with non-zero exit code on suite failure
      --trials <trials>          Override trials per case from config (1-1000)
      --ci                       CI mode: pass/fail on suite pass rate vs threshold
      --threshold <threshold>    Override pass threshold (0.0-1.0)
  -h, --help                     Print help
  -V, --version                  Print version

Syntax: eval run [OPTIONS]

Examples:
  fastskill eval run --agent claude --output-dir ./eval-runs
  fastskill eval run --all --output-dir ./eval-runs --ci --threshold 0.9
